      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765408054199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, I need to return an item. Order number is VF-881-92B.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58628,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765408060399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I'm pulling that up now... I see an order for the Velo Carbon cycling shoes. To get started, could you tell me what specifically is the issue with them?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765408064399999
    },
    {
      "text": "They don't work for me. They're causing terrible blisters, and I've already tried adjusting the cleats. It's a bad fit. Can I get a refund or not?",
