      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58628,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765408075133332
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand, getting blisters is definitely a reason for a return. I just need to check the delivery date to confirm eligibility. One moment...",
