      "user_id": 58628,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765408094866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I see that here. It was delivered 28 days ago. According to our policy, you have 90 days for a return. So, you're well within the window. I can absolutely process this for you.",
