      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765408098999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. So you're sending a return label?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58628,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765408111266664
    },
    {
      "text": "That's correct. I've just initiated the return. You will receive an email with a prepaid shipping label within the next 15 minutes. Once we receive the cycling shoes back at our warehouse, we will issue the full refund to your original payment method.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
